   "ViolationLogAnalyzer(logs) receives logs as [postId, policy, date] triples, sorted by date (non-decreasing; dates are \"YYYY-MM-DD\" so string order is date order; duplicate triples may occur).",
   "countPolicies(postId, startDate, endDate) returns how many distinct policies the post violated on dates within [startDate, endDate].",
   "countPosts(policy, startDate, endDate) returns how many distinct posts violated the policy within the range.",
   "countViolations(startDate, endDate) returns how many distinct (postId, policy) pairs occur within the range.",
   "Ranges are inclusive and an empty range (startDate > endDate) gives 0.",
   "Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing."
